[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17880.47, "timestamp": "04:58:00", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17883.27, "timestamp": "04:58:03", "text": "我的意思是，我本来就是。再来一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17885.83, "timestamp": "04:58:05", "text": "慢炖锅里的肉。哦，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17888.31, "timestamp": "04:58:08", "text": "成群的蜘蛛。我的意思是，是的。呃，怪物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17890.868, "timestamp": "04:58:10", "text": "肉。哦，他们把它拿出来了。我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17895.27, "timestamp": "04:58:15", "text": "一块怪兽肉。我有两个怪物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17897.03, "timestamp": "04:58:17", "text": "等等，这是正确的配方吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17900.39, "timestamp": "04:58:20", "text": "不。嗯，是的，这样可以。好的，我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17903.51, "timestamp": "04:58:23", "text": "看。我的天啊。三种填充物合而为一。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17905.27, "timestamp": "04:58:25", "text": "男生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17908.23, "timestamp": "04:58:28", "text": "三种填充物，一种肉，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17919.43, "timestamp": "04:58:39", "text": "死的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17920.708, "timestamp": "04:58:40", "text": "那边有个肉丸。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17922.39, "timestamp": "04:58:42", "text": "想要就拿吧。饿死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17924.708, "timestamp": "04:58:44", "text": "抓住它。是的。另外，我需要人陪伴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17926.948, "timestamp": "04:58:46", "text": "等等，天黑了。糟糕，天黑了。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17929.19, "timestamp": "04:58:49", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17931.19, "timestamp": "04:58:51", "text": "呃，稍等一下。我可以为你做一颗心，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17935.11, "timestamp": "04:58:55", "text": "思考。我还有足够的钱吗？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17938.55, "timestamp": "04:58:58", "text": "里面需要一个蜘蛛侠。我可以哦，"}]